// "Cold Lips" v8 (id "lips8"; script v8, 2026-10-23, docs/x06-cold-lips.md "Script v8"): she throws her coffee at Denise and threatens a bad review, wants her money and a tip she never left back, Todd hands her Denise's tips,
// Denise explodes, "Anything? Then rub my feet.", she melts and still posts one star: "Cold hands."; the usual at 6 AM loops into the throw.
// Format: see scripts/voice-gen.mjs (lines, directions) and scripts/voice-build.py (cast, plan, gaps, lead, tableSfx). The order of "lines" is the story's order; the numbers are the story's order too.
// Take k of a line uses direction k. Lines 1-10 are lips3's lines with lips3's numbers: their takes t1-t3 (t1-t6 for 1 and 10) are copied from scratch/voice-raw/lips3;
// line 14 is lips3's line 13 (v2's takes). New directions go at the end of a list: lines 2, 6, 9 get t4-t6 and line 10 gets t7-t9 (v6: hysterical, a whisper, exploding, a falsetto shriek).
{
 "title": "Cold Lips v8",
 "cast": {"denise": 1, "customer": 2, "todd": 2},
 "runnerUp": {},
 "lines": [
// shot 3: purple, the phone jabbed at Denise
  {"n": 1, "char": "customer", "text": "Too hot! I'm leaving a bad review!", "dirs": [
   {"t": "[screaming] [furious]", "st": 0.25, "sy": 0.7},
   {"t": "[shrieking] [enraged]", "st": 0.2, "sy": 0.75},
   {"t": "[yelling] [outraged] [shrill]", "st": 0.25, "sy": 0.7},
   {"t": "[screaming] [livid]", "st": 0.3, "sy": 0.65, "text": "TOO HOT! I'm leaving a BAD review!"},
